                                "sense_id": "e3a6f247-56b5-34a1-8974-4be81ce02c1a",
                                "text": "1997, DAN Seemiller, M Holowchak, Winning Table Tennis: Skills, Drills, and Strategies - all 3 versions »\nThe sound at contact should be solid and crisp, not “spinny.”"
                            },
                            {
