                                "sense_id": "e3a6f247-56b5-34a1-8974-4be81ce02c1a",
                                "text": "“It is a spinny thing with wires in it, with the wires wrapped around something (coil) and N and S (unsure what N and S were).\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ac3ee267-ab6b-46b4-b16e-1d059f20c626",
                                "sense_id": "e3a6f247-56b5-34a1-8974-4be81ce02c1a",
                                "text": "Then you got a double whammy - your eyes were full of orange and your head was spinny and dizzy."
